{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-template-js","path":"/linux/read-temperature-without-extra-tools","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<p>Sensor values already provided by the Linux kernel. You just need to find them:</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">paste</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token function\">cat</span> /sys/class/hwmon/hwmon*/temp*_label<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token function\">cat</span> /sys/class/hwmon/hwmon*/temp*_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> <span class=\"token function\">column</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-s</span> <span class=\"token string\">$'<span class=\"token entity\" title=\"\\t\">\\t</span>'</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-t</span> <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> <span class=\"token function\">sed</span> <span class=\"token string\">'s/\\(.\\)..$/.\\1°C/'</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\">edge  40.0°C\nTdie  40.5°C\nTctl  40.5°C</code></pre></div>","excerpt":"Sensor values already provided by the Linux kernel. You just need to find them:","tableOfContents":"","fields":{"socialcard":"gatsby-plugin-social-card/1d7f5f8c-b5d4-5a90-b0ef-12c9e05ce403.jpg"},"frontmatter":{"date":"August 09, 2022","published":"August 09, 2022","lastModified":"August 09, 2022","title":"Read temperature without extra tools","subtitle":null,"section":null,"draft":null,"developing":null,"button